lg:PT-CSC-art171-1-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "a9a59113cd1690805bd2b73e906ba7998f6caf4ab082b35df7afc5ec6e8fb575" ;
    lgo:text "1 - Without prejudice to other mentions required by special laws, in all contracts, correspondence, publications, advertisements, Internet sites and in general in all external activity, companies must clearly indicate, in addition to the firm name, the type, the seat, the registry office where they are registered, their registration number and corporate identification number and, where applicable, the mention that the company is in liquidation."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "SWE-2 (Devin)" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-12"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:PT-CSC-art171-1-q1 .

lg:PT-CSC-art171-2-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "f9329053da009c350aaf6a0fe4032c9d1fd620f20cbeb4ffc9a3a32c674cd630" ;
    lgo:text "2 - Private limited companies, public limited companies and partnerships limited by shares must also indicate the share capital, the amount of paid-up capital, if different, and the amount of own capital according to the last approved balance sheet, whenever the latter is equal to or less than half of the share capital."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "SWE-2 (Devin)" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-12"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:PT-CSC-art171-2-q1 .

lg:PT-CSC-art171-3-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "eac7ea65222952529026354f0d0eaf2cda2d0cc4c99b23c1c8499468cd02e212" ;
    lgo:text "3 - The provisions of paragraph 1 apply to branches of companies having their seat abroad, and these must, in addition to the elements referred to therein, also indicate the registry office where they are registered and their registration number in that registry office."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "SWE-2 (Devin)" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-12"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:PT-CSC-art171-3-q1 .

lg:PT-CSC-title-6df0195790fc-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "6df0195790fcc481b85cf81ac9d424d1fb0c685160f8461e2f2e790e57657361" ;
    lgo:text "Commercial Companies Code"@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "SWE-2 (Devin)" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-12"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translatedProperty eli:title ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
